00:56:21.670 --> 00:56:38.740
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he really loves this one song from Hamilton that never made it into the musical. Maybe because of the name.

00:56:38.740 --> 00:56:41.590
<v Mike Toczek>Always been the burr of somebody's ass.

00:56:41.590 --> 00:56:46.590
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
